@zephinel/dsh-intelligent-ui README · 效果：- 用户问「帮我排一个上海两日游」，模型不再只回一段文字：回答末尾直接渲染一张可点击、可勾选、可拖动的行程页面（地图 + 照片 + 时间线 + 清单 + 预算）。
- 卡片内的 `$变量`、`@Set`、`@functions` 全部在浏览器本地执行：勾选、滑动条、Stepper、计时器、预算分配都不需要再请求模型。
- 只有真正需要继续对话的动作（`@ToAssistant`，例如表单提交）会把一条简短消息放回输入框并发送。

@zephinel/dsh-intelligent-ui README · 构建、测试与部署：- 当前 main 分支验证记录：Node 测试 **247/247**（Host 117、Client 109、packaging 21）；renderer 解析/渲染各 **42/42**，CSS/组件契约 **50/50** 与 **63/63**，排版 **22/22**，i18n **4** 个程序；浏览器 **7/7** 套件通过，其中设置页模板交换 **101** 条、按需流程 **114** 条、交互页面 **46** 条、图片导出 **65** 条断言。浏览器测试覆盖组件/契约；真实模型验证范围与尚未覆盖的场景见[验证记录](https://github.com/Zephinel/dsh-intelligent-ui/blob/main/docs/verification.md)（历史记录）。
- `node scripts/capture-screenshots.mjs` 以固定 DSH token、生产组件与假服务在 Chrome 2x 重建面板、提示、临时结果与设置截图；英文 UI，卡片壳层图标用 lucide 替身。
- `npm run check` 里的排版检查（typography）需要本机 Chrome；没有 Chrome 时该检查会跳过，其余测试仍会运行。非默认安装位置可用 `CHROME_BIN` 指定 Chrome 可执行文件（也适用于浏览器套件）。

@zephinel/dsh-intelligent-ui README · dsh-intelligent-ui：> [!NOTE]
> **Current status**: published on GitHub and npm as **`@zephinel/dsh-intelligent-ui@0.5.0`** (`latest`). Custom styles, on-demand generation, free layouts and template file import/export, plus the renderer-contract, Host-validation and export-semantics fixes, are all included in 0.5.0.

[Quick start](#quick-start) · [Getting the code](#getting-the-code) · [Build, test and deploy](#build-test-and-deploy)

@zephinel/dsh-intelligent-ui README · What it looks like：- When the user asks "plan two days in Shanghai", the model no longer replies with just a paragraph: it renders an itinerary page (map + photos + timeline + checklist + budget) at the end of the answer that can be clicked, checked off and dragged.
- The `$variables`, `@Set` and `@functions` inside the card all execute locally in the browser: checkboxes, sliders, steppers, timers and budget allocation never require another model request.
- Only actions that genuinely need to continue the conversation (`@ToAssistant`, such as a form submission) put a short message back into the composer and send it.

@zephinel/dsh-intelligent-ui README · Quick start：1. Open **Plugins** in the sidebar → **Add plugin** (or the arrow → **Install a third-party plugin**).
2. Enter `@zephinel/dsh-intelligent-ui@0.5.0` (or just the package name for the latest), then click **Install**.
3. When the install finishes, click **Enable now**; if the **UI** control does not appear, quit and reopen DSH Desktop.

@zephinel/dsh-intelligent-ui README · Build, test and deploy：- Current main-branch verification record: **247/247** Node tests (Host 117, Client 109, packaging 21); renderer parse/render **42/42** each, CSS/prop contract **50/50** and **63/63**, typography **22/22**, i18n **4** programs; **7/7** browser suites passed, including **101** settings template-exchange, **114** on-demand, **46** interactive-page and **65** image-export assertions. Browser tests cover components/contracts; real-model validation scope and remaining scenarios are in the [verification record](https://github.com/Zephinel/dsh-intelligent-ui/blob/main/docs/verification.en.md) (historical evidence).
- `node scripts/capture-screenshots.mjs` rebuilds panel, hint, temporary-result and settings captures at 2x in Chrome using fixed DSH tokens, production components and fake services. English UI; shell card glyphs use lucide stand-ins.
- The typography check inside `npm run check` needs a local Chrome; without one that check is skipped and the remaining tests still run. Use `CHROME_BIN` for a non-default Chrome executable location (also used by the browser suites).

@zephinel/dsh-intelligent-ui README · Known limitations：- Temporary styles live in recorded tool arguments/result snapshots, outside the catalog. Replay needs the call arguments in the loaded history window. Saving later depends on the bounded result registry (latest 200 records); an evicted result may still replay but cannot be saved. Saved templates and result snapshots persist in separate JSON files under `<DSH_HOME>`.
- Style creation/on-demand generation uses the deployment's default main-conversation model services; the extension supplies no separate generation model or draft interview service. `ask_user_question` is the structured clarification path; if unavailable, text questions are a degraded fallback — the hint stays and the next message continues the same operation without re-selecting On-demand UI (except after expiry, restart or failure).
- Operations are in memory: armed intent expires after 10 minutes; active operations cannot resume after restart and must be re-armed. Completed results survive. There is one active operation per session: re-arming replaces it while armed, while a bound running/clarifying operation rejects re-arming until explicitly cancelled. Clarif
